{
  "description": "Golden query set v1 (MVP-017; RAG-27; FS-004 metrics). Queries over the repository seed corpus (Phase 1 exit criterion 5); each expects at least one of the listed documents in the top k. Grows with the corpus per RAG-27; recall on this set is the regression baseline.",
